      "updated": 1784064043977,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "2. Functional + Non-Functional\nRequirements",
      "fontSize": 30,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "2. Functional + Non-Functional Requirements",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "bee5475552d2457dba57",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 694.5344575872241,
      "y": 268.72272852545956,
      "width": 550,
      "height": 450,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a1I",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2,
      "version": 21,
      "versionNonce": 1473797715,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1784064040894,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Functional\n• Select exactly one option\n• Disable submit until valid\n• Submit and reconcile canonical server result\n• Preserve selection on failure\n• Retry safely\n• Handle expired / already-voted poll\n• Render zero-vote state correctly\n\nNon-functional\n• Accessible semantic HTML\n• Fast interaction / low INP\n• Idempotent mutation\n• Resilient to unmount / stale request\n• Reusable and typed\n• Works inside large feeds\n• Observable and testable\n• Secure against invalid client input",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Functional\n• Select exactly one option\n• Disable submit until valid\n• Submit and reconcile canonical server result\n• Preserve selection on failure\n• Retry safely\n• Handle expired / already-voted poll\n• Render zero-vote state correctly\n\nNon-functional\n• Accessible semantic HTML\n• Fast interaction / low INP\n• Idempotent mutation\n• Resilient to unmount / stale request\n• Reusable and typed\n• Works inside large feeds\n• Observable and testable\n• Secure against invalid client input",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
