      "updated": 1784064528526,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "*** Optimistic Update *** \n\nAdvantages:\n* Faster perceived response\n* Immediate visual feedback\n* Better experience on slow networks\nRisks:\n* The poll may have expired\n* The user may already have voted on another device\n* The server may reject the request\n* Concurrent vote totals may make the optimistic count inaccurate\n\nA practical approach is:\n1. Optimistically transition to the results view.\n2. Increment the selected option locally.\n3. Send an idempotent request.\n4. Replace optimistic data with the canonical server response.\n5. Roll back when submission fails.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "*** Optimistic Update *** \n\nAdvantages:\n* Faster perceived response\n* Immediate visual feedback\n* Better experience on slow networks\nRisks:\n* The poll may have expired\n* The user may already have voted on another device\n* The server may reject the request\n* Concurrent vote totals may make the optimistic count inaccurate\n\nA practical approach is:\n1. Optimistically transition to the results view.\n2. Increment the selected option locally.\n3. Send an idempotent request.\n4. Replace optimistic data with the canonical server response.\n5. Roll back when submission fails.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
